docs {
  # Audit Logs API

  ## Endpoints

  | Method | Path | Name |
  |--------|------|------|
  | GET | /api/audit-logs/ | list |
  | GET | /api/audit-logs/:id | get-by-id |

  ## Auth & Permission
  - Authentication wajib
  - Permission: `view_audit_log` atau `view_audit_logs`
}
